This program initializes the pigpio library, sets up GPIO pins for the relay and touch sensor, and handles signals for graceful termination. It toggles the relay state on each valid touch detected by the sensor, with a debounce delay to prevent false triggers. The program runs indefinitely until interrupted by a signal like Ctrl+C.

